          hints: ["Use class Dog(Animal):", "Override speak() method"],
          solution: { python: "class Animal:\n    def __init__(self, name):\n        self.name = name\n\nclass Dog(Animal):\n    def speak(self):\n        return f\"{self.name} says Woof!\"\n\nclass Cat(Animal):\n    def speak(self):\n        return f\"{self.name} says Meow!\"" },
          solutionExplanation: "Inheritance allows code reuse and specialization."
        }
      ],
