          content: `Composition vs Inheritance

# Inheritance (is-a)
class Dog(Animal):
    pass

# Composition (has-a)
class Car:
    def __init__(self):
        self.engine = Engine()
        self.wheels = [Wheel(), Wheel(), Wheel(), Wheel()]

When to Use Composition

When you need flexibility
When inheritance doesn't make sense`,
