          content: `Descriptor Protocol

class Descriptor:\n    def __get__(self, obj, objtype):\n        pass\n    \n    def __set__(self, obj, value):\n        pass\n\nUsing Descriptors

class ValidatedAttribute:\n    def __init__(self, name):\n        self.name = name\n    \n    def __get__(self, obj, objtype):\n        return obj.__dict__[self.name]`,
