          whyItMatters: "HTTP requests enable your code to interact with web services.",
          realWorldAnalogy: "HTTP requests are like sending letters - you request and receive information.",
          content: `GET Request

import requests

response = requests.get('https://api.example.com')
print(response.status_code)
